# Place the 5 regulation PDF files in this directory before running db:seed.
# Expected filenames (exactly as listed):
#
#   Law-of-the-Game-2024-Double.pdf
#   Law-of-the-Game-2024-Regu.pdf
#   Law-of-the-Game-2024-Beach-Sepaktakraw.pdf
#   Law-of-the-Game-2024-Quad.pdf
#   STFI-Score-Sheet.pdf
#
# If a file is missing the seeder will still create the database record
# but will mark it as inactive so no broken link appears on the public site.
